Deal.

263
00:16:24,833 --> 00:16:26,497
I'll be your flunky or whatever you want.

264
00:16:26,580 --> 00:16:27,698
Just get this done.

265
00:16:27,860 --> 00:16:29,377
You can have all of my money.

266
00:16:29,460 --> 00:16:31,080
No price is too great!

267
00:16:31,260 --> 00:16:34,613
Hey, Treble, bring sugar to
the palace and make it quick.

268
00:16:35,540 --> 00:16:37,100
Take it easy, Toffee.

269
00:16:37,720 --> 00:16:41,720
They tried to pull something, but
I've got it all under control now.

270
00:16:45,900 --> 00:16:47,040
Uzzelad, wake up!

271
00:16:47,820 --> 00:16:50,577
Why don't you take this
poison grape of yours back?

272
00:16:50,660 --> 00:16:52,000
That's our only hope!

273
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:53,920
Lutata babasco grape!

274
00:16:55,020 --> 00:16:56,880
It's better if you eat it.

275
00:16:57,520 --> 00:16:58,800
Drop dead, will you?

276
00:17:04,340 --> 00:17:05,740
Oh

277
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:31,700
I'm dead, Sugar.

278
00:17:32,160 --> 00:17:33,395
Everything's alright.

279
00:17:33,500 --> 00:17:35,500
Please don't pass out on me, okay?

280
00:17:40,300 --> 00:17:41,130
Look!

281
00:17:41,213 --> 00:17:42,660
Hustle, I did it!

282
00:17:43,020 --> 00:17:45,220
Sugar passed out!

283
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:51,480
Sugar passed out!

284
00:18:01,860 --> 00:18:03,360
He did it!

285
00:18:17,420 --> 00:18:19,200
They're growing big!

286
00:18:19,780 --> 00:18:22,520
Some of them are growing really big!

287
00:18:23,620 --> 00:18:25,120
I'm back!

288
00:18:29,460 --> 00:18:32,020
Kinder, hey! Wake up! Hey!

289
00:18:33,740 --> 00:18:35,140
It's a human!

290
00:18:38,540 --> 00:18:40,780
Something's happening! What?

291
00:18:41,140 --> 00:18:43,820
Those toys are acting rather strangely.

292
00:18:44,780 --> 00:18:46,000
My body!

293
00:18:48,460 --> 00:18:49,290
Who are you?

294
00:18:52,340 --> 00:18:54,180
What's happening to me?

295
00:18:56,280 --> 00:18:57,760
I'm human now!

296
00:18:58,560 --> 00:19:00,160
I need that!

297
00:19:09,480 --> 00:19:10,420
Don't be!

298
00:19:10,660 --> 00:19:11,560
I'm sorry!

299
00:19:12,120 --> 00:19:12,980
I goofed!

300
00:19:13,080 --> 00:19:14,240
I goofed, Rupert!

301
00:19:14,560 --> 00:19:15,390
You're trouble!

302
00:19:15,473 --> 00:19:16,339
It's holding down!

303
00:19:16,500 --> 00:19:19,597
Did something happen to Sugar? She...

304
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:20,557
she...

305
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:22,240
she passed out!

306
00:19:22,460 --> 00:19:24,400
She got scared of pizza!

307
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:31,064
Hey, this is supposed to
be some kind of a joke.

308
00:19:31,340 --> 00:19:33,717
The slaves we've been
collecting for a whole

309
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:36,212
ten years are all turning back to normal.

310
00:19:36,760 --> 00:19:40,400
The Hobby Hobby Fruits
powers are wearing off.

311
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:42,120
I remember now.

312
00:19:42,400 --> 00:19:43,560
What's going on?

313
00:19:43,760 --> 00:19:45,584
The toys in the Coliseum are...

314
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:48,600
What's going on here?

315
00:19:48,900 --> 00:19:50,000
Look at the toys!

316
00:19:50,360 --> 00:19:52,280
They're turning into humans!

317
00:19:58,480 --> 00:20:00,560
Also animals, apparently!

318
00:20:03,860 --> 00:20:05,780
They got her. Sugar!

319
00:20:06,560 --> 00:20:09,640
We worked a whole decade
enslaving all of them!

320
00:20:09,780 --> 00:20:13,740
Must have found Sugar and given
her a trouncing, huh? Pathetic.

321
00:20:14,280 --> 00:20:16,220
That miserable pipsqueak.

322
00:20:17,280 --> 00:20:21,520
But still, I sure hope she wasn't hurt.

323
00:20:21,720 --> 00:20:24,200
Aw, you care about her, don't you?

324
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:27,520
Ellis, please answer!

325
00:20:28,280 --> 00:20:31,277
Sir, all of these emergency
reports keep piling up!

326
00:20:31,360 --> 00:20:33,657
We've got a different
way to that step here!

327
00:20:33,740 --> 00:20:37,152
The toys working at the port
suddenly turned into pirates!

328
00:20:40,020 --> 00:20:41,540
Hey, this is Carter here.

329
00:20:42,020 --> 00:20:44,902
The toys, they turned into
dress-wasted soldiers!

330
00:20:45,060 --> 00:20:48,957
They turned into government officials,
marines, and foreign royalty!

331
00:20:49,040 --> 00:20:50,040
Wild animals!

332
00:20:50,680 --> 00:20:52,680
They're in the Primalist district!

333
00:20:54,400 --> 00:20:55,560
I can't help!

334
00:21:02,420 --> 00:21:03,780
Hang in there.

335
00:21:04,540 --> 00:21:05,370
Usaland!

336
00:21:06,480 --> 00:21:07,310
Usaland!

337
00:21:08,400 --> 00:21:12,340
Me and everyone else, we all
became human again thanks to you!

338
00:21:13,380 --> 00:21:15,420
You did it, Usaland!

339
00:21:15,940 --> 00:21:19,580
Operation SOP is a success thanks to you!

340
00:21:22,140 --> 00:21:26,740
All the people you saved,
they're smiling and cheering.

341
00:21:28,040 --> 00:21:29,640
What's wrong, Winpoko?

342
00:21:30,020 --> 00:21:32,880
Mom, my toy is acting real weird.

343
00:21:36,180 --> 00:21:37,010
What?

344
00:21:37,620 --> 00:21:39,240
Winpoko? Hold on.

345
00:21:39,740 --> 00:21:41,440
Are you...

346
00:21:42,220 --> 00:21:43,300
But how?

347
00:21:43,500 --> 00:21:45,300
My darling, is that you?

348
00:21:47,380 --> 00:21:49,420
I turned back.

349
00:21:49,580 --> 00:21:50,460
Honey!

350
00:21:50,940 --> 00:21:52,760
Dad, you're not Wapoko!

351
00:21:53,420 --> 00:21:55,580
That's right, finally! Daddy!

352
00:21:57,320 --> 00:21:58,680
I don't understand.

353
00:21:59,100 --> 00:22:01,737
Why have we forgotten
about you all this time?

354
00:22:01,820 --> 00:22:03,660
That's how the power works.

355
00:22:03,900 --> 00:22:05,920
I thought I'd be a toy forever.

356
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:12,980
Hey, Daddy, can you lift me
up high? Uh-huh. Like this?

357
00:22:21,400 --> 00:22:22,300
Damn it!

358
00:22:22,420 --> 00:22:23,773
Gone quiet on me again?

359
00:22:23,940 --> 00:22:26,411
Where'd you run off to, you stone bastard?

360
00:22:31,120 --> 00:22:32,180
Come look!

361
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:41,700
I'm not dead yet.

362
00:22:41,860 --> 00:22:44,000
Our hero's alive after all!

363
00:22:46,740 --> 00:22:47,917
He's scared me.

364
00:22:48,000 --> 00:22:49,160
Thanks, Usalind!

365
00:22:49,280 --> 00:22:51,280
I never stop believing in you!

366
00:22:57,280 --> 00:23:00,320
Everything went according to plan.

367
00:23:00,660 --> 00:23:02,220
Just so cool!

368
00:23:05,680 --> 00:23:09,940
And don't worry, you can
leave the rest to my friends.

369
00:23:10,340 --> 00:23:13,540
The real battle has just begun.

370
00:23:15,420 --> 00:23:16,250
Okay!

371
00:23:21,900 --> 00:23:22,800
Rise up!

372
00:23:22,940 --> 00:23:24,640
Take down Doflamingo!

373
00:23:24,760 --> 00:23:27,517
I can't believe that Rotten King
tricked us for all these years!

374
00:23:27,600 --> 00:23:28,560
You've lost it.

375
00:23:28,740 --> 00:23:29,858
He's a fine leader.

376
00:23:30,080 --> 00:23:32,904
We only thought that
because he heard the truth.

377
00:23:33,160 --> 00:23:34,177
He's really...

378
00:23:34,260 --> 00:23:35,180
a demon.

379
00:23:35,660 --> 00:23:37,740
I'll have your head, Doflamingo!

380
00:23:39,300 --> 00:23:40,800
Get out here and fight!

381
00:23:41,120 --> 00:23:44,497
I've got ten years of suffering
I need to pay you back for!

382
00:23:44,580 --> 00:23:47,240
Hey, Isha, any clue what's happening?

383
00:23:48,000 --> 00:23:50,660
It would appear that
the tides have turned.

384
00:23:52,520 --> 00:23:54,200
Despite all appearances,

385
00:23:54,700 --> 00:23:58,582
there is a deep darkness here,
much deeper than I had anticipated.

386
00:23:59,260 --> 00:24:01,680
Go to hell, Doflamingo!

387
00:24:43,540 --> 00:24:45,160
Who's the cape guy?

388
00:24:45,460 --> 00:24:47,337
Kidos, it's you! Huh?

389
00:24:47,420 --> 00:24:49,980
Even I lost my memories of him.

390
00:24:51,240 --> 00:24:52,280
I don't get it.

391
00:24:52,420 --> 00:24:53,420
What do you mean?

392
00:24:54,160 --> 00:24:55,800
Hey, where's the soldier?

393
00:24:56,120 --> 00:24:57,300
That man is him.

394
00:24:57,720 --> 00:24:58,860
How's that work?

395
00:24:59,280 --> 00:25:01,720
Originally, the toys were human like us.

396
00:25:01,900 --> 00:25:05,076
When they changed, they were
erased from our memories.

397
00:25:05,280 --> 00:25:08,104
The girl who did this
sugar passed out just now.

398
00:25:08,280 --> 00:25:10,574
So our memories all came flooding back.

399
00:25:15,380 --> 00:25:18,820
He's the former captain of
King Riku's army, Kiros!

400
00:25:22,820 --> 00:25:26,055
The strongest gladiator in
the history of the Coliseum!

401
00:25:26,980 --> 00:25:29,217
Wait, the guy they have the statue of?

402
00:25:29,300 --> 00:25:34,120
Yes, but more than that, he's my
brother-in-law, Rebecca's father!

403
00:25:36,060 --> 00:25:38,300
But she said she didn't know that guy!

404
00:25:38,860 --> 00:25:43,280
Once our memories are lost, they can't
be regained till Sugar is stopped.

405
00:25:44,180 --> 00:25:48,320
Even so, he's watched over his
daughter for the past ten years.

406
00:25:58,560 --> 00:26:01,207
Even though he was only
a toy soldier to her,

407
00:26:01,420 --> 00:26:05,340
he stayed by her side every day,
protecting her the best he could.

408
00:26:14,040 --> 00:26:15,500
Hey, who goes there?

409
00:26:20,720 --> 00:26:23,980
It's you, Kiros, my boy. Sir!

410
00:26:26,560 --> 00:26:30,700
I'm sorry to keep you waiting
these ten long years, King Rick.

411
00:26:31,420 --> 00:26:34,620
But now, I'm here to save you!

412
00:26:53,500 --> 00:26:57,460
We shall reclaim this
kingdom at long last!

413
00:27:09,000 --> 00:27:10,020
Ten years.

414
00:27:11,880 --> 00:27:15,440
For ten long years, we've suffered.

415
00:27:16,040 --> 00:27:16,870
Hmm.

416
00:27:18,740 --> 00:27:19,780
Toe Flamingo!

417
00:27:19,940 --> 00:27:20,980
Yog-master!

418
00:27:22,260 --> 00:27:23,380
You've been dead!

419
00:27:27,900 --> 00:27:29,280
Mingo just died!

420
00:27:29,480 --> 00:27:30,457
Well, that sucks.

421
00:27:30,540 --> 00:27:32,277
I was gonna be the one to kick his ass.

422
00:27:32,360 --> 00:27:33,190
There they are!

423
00:27:33,273 --> 00:27:34,103
I see ya!

424
00:27:34,186 --> 00:27:35,016
Get there!

425
00:27:35,099 --> 00:27:35,929
They found us.

426
00:27:36,760 --> 00:27:38,740
We've got to go save Traffy!

427
00:27:39,980 --> 00:27:42,820
I don't even know how to explain this!

428
00:27:43,060 --> 00:27:44,200
It's inconceivable!

429
00:27:48,440 --> 00:27:51,880
Where the hell did this
gorilla come from? Run!

430
00:27:54,180 --> 00:27:56,540
I can't believe this.

431
00:27:57,260 --> 00:27:58,090
Shrebel.

432
00:27:58,580 --> 00:28:00,760
Left sugar unguarded?

433
00:28:01,060 --> 00:28:03,060
Hey, I'm not your babysitter.

434
00:28:03,440 --> 00:28:04,640
Stop your bawling.

435
00:28:05,140 --> 00:28:06,380
It's not like that.

436
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:09,880
I had...

437
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:11,940
I had a father.

438
00:28:14,280 --> 00:28:18,751
Now that the smoke is clear, it's time
we uncover the truth, right, Rebecca?

439
00:28:21,420 --> 00:28:23,891
There's a core at the heart of all things.

440
00:28:25,080 --> 00:28:26,537
Once you find that...

441
00:28:26,620 --> 00:28:27,600
You lost me!

442
00:28:27,760 --> 00:28:30,297
You sound cool as hell, and I
still look up to you, of course.

443
00:28:30,380 --> 00:28:31,980
but, uh, you lost me!

444
00:28:32,940 --> 00:28:36,700
Even the ring we stand in now has a core.

445
00:28:39,260 --> 00:28:42,480
I think it's about time we wrap this up.

446
00:28:52,320 --> 00:28:53,800
Dragon Claw Fist?

447
00:28:57,200 --> 00:28:58,030
Dragon!

448
00:29:09,560 --> 00:29:15,320
Unbelievable that was a single blow
from Lucy the ring's going under.

449
00:29:16,380 --> 00:29:18,440
The whole ring has exploded.

450
00:29:23,220 --> 00:29:27,377
That's great, what the hell did you do?

451
00:29:27,460 --> 00:29:29,177
Got places to be?

452
00:29:29,260 --> 00:29:30,480
Need to win!

453
00:29:35,160 --> 00:29:37,042
What's a lot commotion up there?

454
00:29:37,320 --> 00:29:38,150
Hey, Hawk.

455
00:29:38,520 --> 00:29:40,579
Did he do something reckless again?

456
00:29:41,680 --> 00:29:43,386
He's heading underground now.
